## A.6.4 Smartphone Sensors Modules

This directory contains the necessary patches and objects to work with smartphone sensor integration.

Within this folder, you will find two main subdirectories:

1. **Purr Data Version**: Contains all the files and patches specifically configured for **Purr Data**.
2. **Plug Data Version**: Contains all the files and patches specifically configured for **PlugData**.

### Usage Note
To run these modules, you need to create a main patch and call the required objects included in this repository.
